{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1415404800, "end_date": 1416095999, "month_true_total": 636, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:09:13 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "12958059", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049241233", "personaname": "Shiro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/YakuzaShiro/", "num_games_owned": 580, "num_reviews": 78, "playtime_forever": 1572, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 915, "last_played": 1571538180, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rogue-like game that's all about them upgrades baby, waste'em mosters, get money, dump it some upgrade, rinse and repeat.  Replayability comes through the different characters and items that you get through each playthrough.  And the game actually has a decent lore to it. Yay!", "timestamp_created": 1416087344, "timestamp_updated": 1416087344, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12957131", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011178522", "personaname": "An Hero Appeared", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/anheroappeared/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2214, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 973, "last_played": 1547413633, "avatar": "bc654b89ab364a7a8b3e6af374eb54d7ff3ad801"}, "language": "english", "review": "i barely have any hours put into this but i find this game so addictingly fun once you get comfortable with the control and gameplay mechanics.  The plethora of item power up combinations make each try a new experience.", "timestam