on your toes along with calculating routes.\n\nThe enemy spawn system is sadistic after five minutes. If you try to hide and regenerate health or avoid a enemy, chances are the game will spawn three formidable monsters, or spawn the monster you were trying to avoid. Sometimes the game gets sick of how good you're doing and throws two bosses at you along with 50 monsters. Most enemies move FASTER than you, so if you're ill-equipped you can be swarmed which ultimately results in death.\n\nAnd death is serious because you permanently lose your character.", "timestamp_created": 1416082828, "timestamp_updated": 1416082883, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.458404064178466797", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12957023", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045235251", "personaname": "ゴジラの最初の犠牲虜", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fog616/", "num_games_owned": 1778, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 21116, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15867, "last_played": 1703729438, "avatar": "d157bc1a85591604e2e76ec338d82db7c51819a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I play a lot of Risk Of Rain. Out of all my games I have the second most playtime on this little rouge-like. There is no game I would recommend getting more than Risk of Rain, it is beautiful it is fun and it is one of the best games I have ever played.", "timestamp_created": 1416082802, "timestamp_updated": 1461102435, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendati